{
  "about": "Named sound cues a move calls with ctx.sfx(t, cue). Each cue lists takes from two kits: kit/ (earshot launch kit by Leon Lin, MIT — kit/LICENSE.txt, with measured onsets in kit/kit.json) and the director's CC0 effects (lib/director-engine/assets/sfx). The mixer picks a take by the move's index so repeats vary, aligns it on its onset, and keeps about one sound a second (at most two within 150 ms).",
